<title>USA: U.S. stockpile outlines rubber sales program.</title>
<headline>U.S. stockpile outlines rubber sales program.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Defense Stockpile Center said it has approximately 32,000 long tons of natural rubber for sale starting next month.</p>
<p>The first monthly sale date is January 22, 1997. If all the rubber is not sold in January, offers will be received for all remaining material on February 26, and the fourth Wednesday of each subsequent month until the quantity is sold.</p>
<p>((New York Commodities 212-859-1646))</p>
</text>
